Arjun, thanks for sending your question.

If you're able to send a reproducible example of the problem you're seeing, that would be most helpful for investigating the issue.  In particular, that would require the data files (simulated_capture.csv and simulated_forklength.csv), and also including a set.seed(VALUE) call at the beginning of the script, where VALUE represents some number - this allows the execution to be exactly reproduced.

