Did you define the logdensity.bin nimbleFunction before calling nimbleModel? The error is saying that when nimbleModel tries to construct the DAG of relationships among nodes, it can't find logdensity.bin as a nimbleFunction (and the alternative would be if all inputs are constants so it can call it as an R function once and only once, which is not a very common situation). Feel free to send the code, reduced to a minimal example if possible, off-list if you prefer. -Perry

