Subject: Stochastic node sampling only single value
Message-ID: <ozDi-gDKhcw.xTlN1seJCgAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/nimble-users/c/ozDi-gDKhcw/m/xTlN1seJCgAJ>
